{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.open","lesson_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0","sequence":0,"board":{"board_id":"linear-plotting-points","base_revision":0,"region_intent":"new_topic","region_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0-region"},"lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"一次函数 y = 2x - 1 的图像本质与画法","goals":["理解一次函数图像是满足方程 y = 2x - 1 的所有点 (x, y) 的集合","通过多点采样与数值代入，建立自变量 x 与因变量 y 的对应直觉","掌握“两点确定一条直线”的性质，并能寻找坐标轴交点快速画图"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["动态点集生成法：从孤立坐标点渐进过渡到连续直线","代入验证与数值联动：拖拽自变量直观验证解析式","简化画图策略：提炼关键截距点，降低画图复杂度"]},"variables":[{"as":"number_01","initial":-1,"min":-3,"max":3,"label":"点A横坐标","control":{"kind":"slider","step":0.03}},{"as":"number_02","initial":0,"min":-3,"max":3,"label":"点B横坐标","control":{"kind":"slider","step":0.03}},{"as":"number_03","initial":1,"min":-3,"max":3,"label":"点C横坐标"},{"as":"number_04","initial":2,"min":-3,"max":3,"label":"点D横坐标"}],"tasks":[{"as":"section-01-task-01","prompt":"请把点A横坐标调到 3。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["拖动左下角的滑杆，观察数值和画面同步变化。"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"完成，点A横坐标已经调到 3。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":3,"tolerance":0.015}},{"as":"section-02-task-01","prompt":"将点 A 的横坐标调整至 2，验证此时纵坐标 y = 2×2 - 1 = 3。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["向右拖动点 A 滑块，使横坐标达到 2","观察此时纵坐标是否等于 3"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"太棒了！当 x = 2 时，y = 3，满足方程 y = 2x - 1。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":2.01,"tolerance":0.015}},{"as":"section-03-task-01","prompt":"请将点 B 的横坐标设置为 0.5，找到图像与 x 轴的交点","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["解方程 0 = 2x - 1 可得 x = 0.5","拖动点 B 的滑块至 0.5 处"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"太棒了！你精准找到了与 x 轴的交点 (0.5, 0)！","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_02","controls":["slider"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_02","value":0.51,"tolerance":0.015}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-01","purpose":"建立图像本质直觉：从方程关系式到平面坐标点的映射","beats":[{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-01:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"欢迎来到一次函数的世界。当我们看到方程 y = 2x - 1 时，它不仅是一个代数等式，更代表着坐标平面上一系列坐标点之间的紧密联系。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","kind":"plot","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"一次函数图像","axes":{"x":{"min":-3,"max":3,"label":"x"},"y":{"min":-10,"max":10,"label":"y"}},"curves":[{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:primary-curve","expression":"((2)*(x))-(1)","label":"y = 2x - 1"}],"points":[{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:moving-point","x":-1,"y":-3,"label":"A"},{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:second-point","x":0,"y":-1,"label":"B"}],"bindings":[{"target":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:moving-point.x","expression":"number_01"},{"target":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:moving-point.y","expression":"((2)*(number_01))-(1)"},{"target":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:second-point.x","expression":"number_02"},{"target":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:second-point.y","expression":"((2)*(number_02))-(1)"}],"measurement":"secant"},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0-region"}}],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:1:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"y = 2x - 1"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0-region"}},{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:1:1:3","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"引导学习者观察坐标系与函数解析式的对应关系"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-01:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"直线上每一个点的横坐标 x 和纵坐标 y，代入方程后都能使等式成立。反过来，所有满足这个等式的点 (x, y) 连在一起，就构成了这条直线。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:1:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"图像本质","items":["图像上的每一个点 (x, y) 都满足函数解析式","满足解析式的所有点汇聚成连续的直线"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02"},"region_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0-region"}},{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:1:2:2","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0","sequence":2,"step":{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-02","purpose":"通过多点采样与动态互动，验证代入计算与点集分布规律","beats":[{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-02:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"一次函数 y = 2x - 1 的图像，本质上就是由平面上所有满足这个等式的坐标点 (x, y) 聚集而成的直线。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:2:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"强调一次函数图像与解析式中坐标点集的对应关系"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-02:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"我们可以沿着直线移动采样点，当 x 取不同值时，代入 2x - 1 就能精确计算出对应的 y 值。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:2:2:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":1,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-02:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"现在请你动手试一试，把点 A 的横坐标拖拽到 2 的位置，观察对应的纵坐标变化并验证解析式。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:2:3:1","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0","sequence":3,"step":{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-03","purpose":"理解两点确定一条直线，学会利用坐标轴交点快速绘制图像","beats":[{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-03:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"虽然一次函数的图像由无限多个点组成，但在几何上，两点就能确定一条唯一的直线。因此画图时，我们只需确定两个特殊的点即可。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:3:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-03-moment-01-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"两点确定一条直线","items":["画一次函数图像只需求出两个点","连接两点并向两端延伸即可完成画图"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0-region"}},{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:3:1:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"理解两点确定一条直线的几何性质"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-03:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"最方便找的两个点就是与坐标轴的交点。当 x 等于 0 时，y 等于负 1，得到与 y 轴的交点 (0, -1)；当 y 等于 0 时，x 等于二分之一，得到与 x 轴的交点 (0.5, 0)。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:3:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"\\begin{cases} x = 0 \\Rightarrow y = -1 & \\text{与y轴交点 } (0, -1) \\\\ y = 0 \\Rightarrow x = 0.5 & \\text{与x轴交点 } (0.5, 0) \\end{cases}"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-03-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0-region"}},{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:3:2:2","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":0,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}},{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:3:2:3","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_02","to":0.5,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:step:section-03:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"请你试着将点 B 的横坐标调整到 0.5，观察与 x 轴的交点情况。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:action:3:3:1","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.close","lesson_id":"linear-plotting-points-0.1.0","sequence":4,"result":{"summary":"本课程深入探讨了一次函数 y = 2x - 1 的图像本质。图像上的每一个点都是使等式成立的坐标对 (x, y)。在实际作图中，无需绘制无数个点，只需利用“两点确定一条直线”的几何性质，找出与坐标轴的交点即可快速准确地画出一次函数图像。","summary_node_refs":[],"suggested_focus":["linear-plotting-points-0.1.0:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"]}}
